{"a":"nm:johnny sincere","b":"nm:willie foster","items":[{"doc":"alma9945593558306326","title":"Willie Foster Interview","inst":"tulane","who":"Willie Foster","rel":"toured with","dir":"mutual","conf":0.9,"q":"I bought a banjo in two weeks' time and went on the Capitol and I made a week's trip with him","ctx":[{"s":"Richard B. Allen","x":"Was that Johnny Sincere?","src":0},{"s":"Willie Foster","x":"That's right. Johnny Sincere.","src":1},{"s":"Richard B. Allen","x":"I know him very well.","src":0}],"pg":0,"bl":44}],"more":0}